{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_title", "source_sha256": "a2184de62d14099b8f12226699660013dc6c4f828879074dab0cc04e425af9ed", "ja": "つま先の冒険", "zh": "脚尖的冒险", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b856c5d56d060db0a85d62caf7f247ede54a5f583aa504754c442e98f5f09951", "ja": "新曲をCMコンペに出す事になった志保は、\n皆と出かけた先でカフェを気にしていた。\n後日尋ねると「一人でお茶をした事がない」\nと言う志保。慌てて響と歌織に集合を掛ける\nまつりと歩。皆が集まり、お茶が始まった。", "zh": "新曲决定参与广告比稿的志保，\n在外出时留意起了沿途的咖啡馆。\n日后一问，志保坦言自己“从没一个人去喝过茶”。\n茉莉和步见状急忙叫来响与歌织。\n大家齐聚一堂，下午茶时光就此开始。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1000_null", "source_sha256": "00e4395b28cc0a41978efd0f4f2746cfefcb809825a27a9442375bb12eb846ef", "ja": "ショッピングモール……", "zh": "购物中心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "39bbb2de4fdc3f7aaf2cc16f85721daedcde6b64d7c9b3260fe2972f9ab48e23", "ja": "いや～～～買った買った！\n大満足だよ！", "zh": "哎呀～～～买得好过瘾！\n太满足了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "30513311f87854a26eda5a28fc1e7815f834e450c99bd197a57d718289049e42", "ja": "歩ちゃん、袋がパンパンなのです……。そんなに\n買い物して、今月のお小遣いは大丈夫なのです？", "zh": "小步，袋子都塞得满满的了……买了这么多东西，这个月的零花钱够用吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "1097aa1017ca2babc13c966a572f12d6506de6f3ac621d65fc085e6bf8459d57", "ja": "うっ！？　……い、いやっ、大丈夫！　それに\nオシャレも、アイドルとしての嗜みだし！　うんっ！", "zh": "呜！？……没、没事！而且，时尚也是身为偶像应有的修养嘛！嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1004_052kao", "source_sha256": "f8491d76fe68e8c64ba85a7e803d9558fff62302146508328874917f3917f251", "ja": "本当に、いろんな服があったわね。\n値段もどれも手頃で、つい目移りしてしまって。", "zh": "真的有好多不同的衣服呢。\n而且价格都很实惠，不知不觉就看花了眼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "a6c72748b0bf1da301bf1d17f43bef9dd08295ea1ba73c2705e9fdaf682fb72e", "ja": "自分も、いい感じのスウェットを見つけたから、\nチェックしておいたぞ！", "zh": "我也找到了一件感觉很不错的运动衫，先记下来了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "4cb53bcba51872c0688b3acd4336909ddf437b03e13ba7507d49c9015f855747", "ja": "来週になっても気が変わらなかったら、\nまた買いに来ようと思ってるんだ。", "zh": "如果到了下周还没有改变主意，我打算再来买。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "ab4d09b22cd2e6ed8721174c4498f7d77ac3befad3cd255e883b16338791cba4", "ja": "響ちゃん、しっかりしてるのです。\n流石なのです。", "zh": "响妹妹真是可靠呢。果然很厉害。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "7e09d6d79f926c51f531bc5ee7e12e25cbf360bb090b4f858e31c3c91a40d9b9", "ja": "どしたの、志保。\n……カフェ？　あ、お茶飲んでく？", "zh": "怎么了，志保。\n……咖啡？啊，要不要喝杯茶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1010_033sih", "source_sha256": "6eb5f30ba3a0dd1ac4525369a11897d013354df84a6542e7acc6790f293b4b13", "ja": "い、いえ。いいんです。\nその、ちょっと気になっただけなので。", "zh": "不、不用了。没关系的。\n那个，只是有点在意而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "57e4d343bbb2fa35e189b51ea0e9bfa7eda44a454991df3aef2ada9a21e47640", "ja": "そう？　まあチェーン店だし、\n後でひとりでも来られるか。", "zh": "这样？不过毕竟是连锁店，之后一个人也能来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1012_033sih", "source_sha256": "8d7ec7a8d2dce4e0aed0d8044748b04be7484522cf9d260450845268230fcc31", "ja": "ひとりで……。", "zh": "一个人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1013_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1014_p", "source_sha256": "5fd38ddfa4a5eb1cbe775dbc67357dde9b0ff65efe34b0c41b6c7a014a4b83c5", "ja": "（今日は定期公演のレッスン。\n歌織さんと響は取材で不在だから、3人だけだ）", "zh": "（今天是定期公演的排练。歌织小姐和响去接受采访了，所以这里只有3人）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "28490230fcef2aeb194793944dc13ef22b5aec8d217174d85628db461e554cbe", "ja": "うん、今のところはだいたいOKだね！\nそれじゃ、今日はここまでにしようか？", "zh": "嗯，目前为止基本没问题了！\n那么，今天就练到这里吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1016_021mat", "source_sha256": "126bb0aaec802dff67d8121e1cc1411070590b36af06428f5743d3c33f2c38cf", "ja": "お疲れさまなのです！　この時間だと、歌織ちゃんと\n響ちゃんの取材も、そろそろ終わる頃ですね。", "zh": "辛苦啦！按这个时间，歌织和响的采访也差不多该结束了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
