{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1019_033sih", "source_sha256": "90ee176f96748ba565c205d65a7965d6c1ad2f95ed81af0636b9582ae1721d6d", "ja": "あ、いえ。\n……すごく順調だなと思っただけです。", "zh": "啊，不是。\n……只是觉得，进展得非常顺利。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1020_p", "source_sha256": "11c0071c73843465bc690d04b2e60cc96279897c06f7bb7b9876c2ac77e8ce05", "ja": "そうだな。\n実際、かなりいいペースで進んでると思うよ。", "zh": "是啊。\n实际上，我觉得进展得相当顺利。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1021_033sih", "source_sha256": "57667239d5e7828b1aebbf1372d2b6cabbde0325b5bd999ed567a3d0b75ee49e", "ja": "なんだか不思議です。まつりさんと歩さん以外は、\nみんな年齢もバラバラだし……。", "zh": "总觉得很不可思议。除了茉莉和步以外，大家的年龄也各不相同……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1022_033sih", "source_sha256": "80a4aba61a06f18dc0475a523c7075a57babf8c183a9a1d8be7a4c65b5726168", "ja": "マイペースなのに、安定してるっていうか……。\n可奈や未来達とのレッスンとは、全然違う気がして。", "zh": "明明各有各的节奏，却又很稳定……这种感觉和可奈、未来她们一起上课时，完全不一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1023_p", "source_sha256": "c8a302340b2be36f97117e3f4d35a16ad60bd2bd63a41fe2c4d15dd7988e624e", "ja": "そうかな。\nむしろ、マイペースだからいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "是吗？\n倒不如说，正因为按自己的节奏来，不是更好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1024_033sih", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
