{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1039_013hib", "source_sha256": "7e7fef2714846213df61a5470ac859f1d4ff8531d944b70785b2f884e56e2e62", "ja": "へー。ドリンクを注文するとスクラッチがもらえて、\nそのポイントと交換でオマケがもらえるんだ。", "zh": "哦——点饮料就能拿到刮刮卡，还能用刮出的积分兑换赠品。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1040_013hib", "source_sha256": "6ae7b0e0a5777fa2eaeb2920b99a3ba61403403b0645c387c8c0901bf6f1ce1b", "ja": "黒猫のグッズかぁ。\n自分の家のねこ吉は白猫だけど、黒猫もかわいいね！", "zh": "黑猫的周边啊。自家的猫吉是只白猫，不过黑猫也很可爱呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1041_052kao", "source_sha256": "8b08ce7796a04cea75a553b80e5ade6f96f17d92d36238b61892b37f987e0020", "ja": "志保ちゃんが見てたのは、これだったのね。\nじゃあ私の分のポイントは、志保ちゃんに♪", "zh": "志保看的就是这个呀。\n那我那份积分，就送给志保吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1042_013hib", "source_sha256": "ed4fc488d7f8904605cbf93ab4016e53be0928bfdcf889bd4f8e62a9eba265a7", "ja": "志保、自分のポイントもあげるぞ！", "zh": "志保，我的积分也给你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1043_021mat", "source_sha256": "445954849535985a8c15a1be5a6e8810d3c5c3790d400cc5b24af075640eff1f", "ja": "もちろん、姫と歩ちゃんの分もなのです！\nこれで何ポイントなのです？", "zh": "当然，公主和步的份也算上！\n这样一来有几点了呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1044_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d77b5ea7142fa8dc2efd188540527621b725ec4a6f2da3ae5978069deea0c82c", "ja": "えーと……惜しい、9ポイント！\nあと1回お茶したら、交換できるよ。", "zh": "呃……真可惜，是9分！再喝1次茶，就能兑换了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1045_013hib", "source_sha256": "1234a88795be14dbed6f1e1647770a26b7aacc373af752ad0471365599995204", "ja": "5人いるから、あっという間に集まったね！\n自分、おかわりしようか？", "zh": "有5个人在，一眨眼就集齐了呢！\n要不要我再去续一杯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1046_033sih", "source_sha256": "65d6bef4f7becc3035046515a325e5b69ca9c7e2d6088534ee132e925ad54a58", "ja": "そ、そこまでしてもらうわけには……\nというか、あの。", "zh": "不、不用做到这种程度……\n那个，怎么说呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1047_033sih", "source_sha256": "96be68b776f43d0bf594f6bb2ba9a46dccc5aea47c52aedd1f645e48313eedd2", "ja": "このポイント、私がもらってしまって、\n本当にいいんですか？", "zh": "这些点数真的可以让我拿走吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1048_013hib", "source_sha256": "27b9b44ef1e5d4315a3f84c09eba5c0fb3971728c23e4e5598589dadaae18608", "ja": "え？　だって志保、欲しいんでしょ？\nだったら、遠慮することないぞ！", "zh": "诶？因为志保你想要，对吧？\n既然这样，就不用客气了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1049_021mat", "source_sha256": "1afacaf4dc86cebae90e39c25dfe6c9168635a82205d798862e64f63e54ea247", "ja": "みんなの気が変わらないうちに、\nもらっておくのですよ♪", "zh": "趁大家还没改变主意，先收下吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1050_033sih", "source_sha256": "405ee3acdab7a8211724fcb3f8ff9c455dfa6a4dd08ca2a74b56c3f2db74f235", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます……。", "zh": "啊，谢谢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1051_052kao", "source_sha256": "0acb640df9c30464ebeacb0899f82bcdcd743d558716d3b75d4f103581565a42", "ja": "志保ちゃんは、あまりこういうお店には来ないの？", "zh": "志保平时不太来这种店吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1052_033sih", "source_sha256": "78a053373f1912539b6c2e5b68c272b426b07f2ff023798637dcf26adc307209", "ja": "そうですね……。母と弟と一緒だと、\nカフェとかには……。", "zh": "是啊……和妈妈还有弟弟一起的话，像咖啡馆这种地方……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1053_033sih", "source_sha256": "2de4a96cb5e658b2c20159ebd36a3a935a3fed3dc6e5af30d798378b88f09d08", "ja": "弟がまだ小さいので、ドーナツ屋さんとか……\nあとはファストフードとファミレスなんかが多いです。", "zh": "弟弟年纪还小，所以一般去甜甜圈店……\n剩下的就是快餐店和家庭餐厅比较多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1054_013hib", "source_sha256": "24bde37655d2a9d1fd656f8bd5fe708aa7d63667eb0dc31f4571a6f007be26a0", "ja": "言われてみれば……\n小さい子は、コーヒーなんて飲まないよね。", "zh": "这么说来……\n小孩子是不喝咖啡的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1055_052kao", "source_sha256": "b0b3c48fb5cce88c8afc804a01faf32d95b6bf9069d838188ab66e224c98fe4d", "ja": "私もね、中学生の頃、初めてひとりでお茶をしたの。\n隣の駅まで行って、駅前のカフェに入って……。", "zh": "我也是呢，我上初中的时候，第一次一个人去喝茶。去了隔壁车站，在车站前的一家咖啡馆里坐下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1056_052kao", "source_sha256": "94eb420d9c87a2d8fcc9b11bf2b4c979dd186048d5fd0840fb306e861004baa5", "ja": "緊張したけど、とっても楽しかった。\nなんだか、秘密を持ったみたいで。", "zh": "虽然很紧张，但特别开心。总觉得像是有了一个秘密似的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1057_033sih", "source_sha256": "398f649f3b59f00a3f7c2d4072c4b69313cbc780ce1d9593a06c91f33f8fca11", "ja": "秘密……。", "zh": "秘密……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1058_052kao", "source_sha256": "3235362ad5d32dec310b2beab8a5621036a1aa1730acdde4074b6f1f4a418b11", "ja": "それだけで、大人になったような、\n自由になったみたいな気がしたの。ふふ、変よね。", "zh": "仅仅那样，就让我觉得自己仿佛长大了，也仿佛获得了自由。呵呵，很奇怪吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1059_033sih", "source_sha256": "71e299cfdf38406a9d6616df00ad409fe85ae76b5ec4d71f46c6805dcd4e17a7", "ja": "……いえ。\nそういうの……素敵だと思います。", "zh": "……不。\n我觉得那样……很美好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1060_052kao", "source_sha256": "0f2f5115cd263794a6583c48ddce5fe8046da5f8cb5c23ab591d78672129e6d9", "ja": "本当？　なら志保ちゃんにも、\nいつか味わってみてほしいな……なんて。", "zh": "真的吗？那也希望志保有一天能亲自体验一下……我是这么想的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1061_034ayu", "source_sha256": "77bcd33ffc097850ddee3ad04485fbac4bb47e058e099f6e16957fcdb1a382a9", "ja": "大人で、自由かぁ。\nアタシは……アメリカ留学した時に思ったかな？", "zh": "长大成人、自由自在啊。\n我大概是……去美国留学的时候有这种感觉的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1062_013hib", "source_sha256": "d907da995927e15f8d11728f0e9d1a71139694bd2d9adc96eea9507a0a8f5b8d", "ja": "自分は、東京に来た時だぞ！\nすっごく遠かったしね！", "zh": "我是在来到东京的时候哦！因为真的非常远嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1064_null", "source_sha256": "de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481", "ja": "翌日……", "zh": "隔天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1065_se", "source_sha256": "c01f9901aa06ad650b314d5a929022d1574a5f17402b31fd5bd6359592e719d6", "ja": "コンコン、ガチャ", "zh": "咚咚，咔嚓", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1066_033sih", "source_sha256": "7efca0719f26b0613c83d91d9aae6602b78e86abca22f0c80b53f61df3689ef2", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです。\nレッスンルームの鍵を返しに来ました。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了。\n我来还练习室的钥匙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1067_p", "source_sha256": "441efda50a44cee5d5f773903a435bd48a895354bdcd5a76fd4946b7ca870493", "ja": "志保、お疲れ様。そういえば昨日はあの後、\nみんなとカフェに行ったのか？", "zh": "志保，辛苦了。对了，昨天之后，你和大家一起去咖啡厅了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1068_033sih", "source_sha256": "a3f3b46abd98ac26ffe62c1b524b545ab9fb0a8cddf9736b6592428aa43d7e16", "ja": "はい。……あの、{$P$}さん。\nちょっと、意見を聞かせてほしいんですけど……。", "zh": "好的。……那个，{$P$}先生。\n我想听听你的意见……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1069_p", "source_sha256": "e1d825864acb2300c0f937c5827cd59ff49c1297974d53460879691abbce3e42", "ja": "ん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1070_p", "source_sha256": "ddba2ad22dcdf13a99c875d067b7538c582e45ddc5d71b298a6c8e11c7e34d9a", "ja": "へえ、歌織さんがそんな事を。", "zh": "哦，歌织小姐居然做过那种事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1071_033sih", "source_sha256": "59ac79be5a3b4e778416d3a194f5e7d84ab05fda0015fb75f82af96086a0142f", "ja": "私がアイドルを始めたきっかけは、母を助けたい……\nそのための、お金が欲しかったからです。", "zh": "我开始做偶像的契机，是想帮助母亲……\n为此，我需要钱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1072_p", "source_sha256": "af2950532c5a186cb93b80aab92f83dcd5f26d80bc31108307ed0c834aeccfe6", "ja": "そうだったな。", "zh": "对，是这么回事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1073_033sih", "source_sha256": "ed23d80fb1237f9d577129340949170e60270d9deb01233c02d9c0116d3040b6", "ja": "その私が、カフェでお茶をするとか……。\nそういうことに、お金を使ってもいいんでしょうか。", "zh": "我居然要在咖啡馆喝茶什么的……\n把钱花在这种事情上，真的可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1074_033sih", "source_sha256": "831c453437c114d1b4edb38815361b3640f72d23fc175d02f41720774b400357", "ja": "まだ、中学生なのに。", "zh": "明明还只是初中生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1075_p", "source_sha256": "ea710e03b2d0aa70a011ba0bdc4f1448128848dee40c04fffc177c858e9c52ea", "ja": "もう中学生なんだし、いいと思うよ。", "zh": "都已经是中学生了，我觉得挺好的呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_161_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_161_1076_p", "source_sha256": "fa8b3bad8ff638f9c2db6ea69c3e9b9e2f17cc05e7fda51af220ec756840fcdc", "ja": "それに、自分がどんなものや、どんなことを\n好きなのか、知っていくのはいい事だと思う。", "zh": "而且，逐渐了解自己喜欢什么样的东西、喜欢做什么，我觉得也是件好事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
